{%- comment -%} SEO content band: descriptive copy for search + customers {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="tb-seo">
  <div class="tb-seo-inner">
    <h2>Custom Embroidered Hats, Made in Burlington, North Carolina</h2>
    <p>Threadbreak is a custom embroidery shop based in Burlington, North Carolina, specializing in custom embroidered hats for businesses, brands, teams, and events. Every order is digitized, embroidered, inspected, and shipped from our own shop, so you get consistent, high-quality results without the middleman. Whether you need a single hat or a few hundred, we make it easy to put your logo on a cap you will actually want to wear.</p>
    <p>We carry a curated lineup of the most popular blank hats in the industry, including structured trucker caps, flat-bill snapbacks, rope hats, five-panel and seven-panel styles, and premium performance caps. Popular options include the Richardson 112, Richardson 168 seven-panel, Richardson 256 Umpqua rope hat, Yupoong retro truckers, Otto five-panel caps, and more. Each style is available in a wide range of colors, so you can match your brand exactly.</p>
    <p>Pricing works on volume: order as few as one hat, with the per-hat price dropping as your quantity grows. We digitize your logo for embroidery at no extra charge, and shipping is always free anywhere in the United States. For businesses and organizations, our wholesale pricing on larger runs makes branded headwear an affordable, professional way to promote your company, outfit your team, or hand out merchandise at events.</p>
    <p>Beyond embroidery, we also offer laser-engraved leatherette patch hats for a premium, textured look, along with DTG printing for apparel. Have a question before you order, or need a rush? Reach out to <a href="mailto:help@threadbreak.com">help@threadbreak.com</a> and we will help you get exactly what you need. Ready to get started? <a href="/pages/custom-order">Place a custom order</a> or <a href="/pages/quote">request a quote</a> today.</p>
  </div>
</section>
